  "politicaSeccion1Titulo": "1. Data controller",
  "politicaSeccion1Texto": "SEREO is a platform developed for the University Wellbeing area of Universidad de Cundinamarca, aimed at the psychological and emotional support of its student community. The University Wellbeing area acts as the controller of the personal data collected through this application.",
  "politicaSeccion2Titulo": "2. Data collected",
  "politicaSeccion2Texto": "• Identification data: full name, institutional email, academic program.\n• Access credentials: password (stored in encrypted form).\n• Sensitive mental health data: priority care requests (SOS), emotional journal, psychological self-assessments, and history of appointments with Wellbeing professionals.\n• Technical data: application preferences and session data.",
  "politicaSeccion3Titulo": "3. Purpose of the processing",
  "politicaSeccion3Texto": "To verify your identity and membership of the university community, manage psychological care requests and appointments, allow authorized professionals to follow up on your emotional wellbeing, and generate aggregated, anonymous statistics to support institutional decisions.",
  "politicaSeccion4Titulo": "4. Confidentiality of sensitive information",
  "politicaSeccion4Texto": "Information related to your emotional state (journal, self-assessments, SOS requests) is confidential. Only authorized Wellbeing staff have access, and only in the context necessary to provide you with care. The system’s administrative staff do NOT have access to this information under any circumstances.",
  "politicaSeccion5Titulo": "5. Data retention",
  "politicaSeccion5Texto": "Information is not permanently deleted. Requests, appointments and accounts can be cancelled or deactivated, but they are kept for traceability, audit and continuity of support.",
  "politicaSeccion6Titulo": "6. Your rights",
  "politicaSeccion6Texto": "You have the right to know, update and rectify your data; to be informed about how it is used; to file complaints with the competent authorities; and to revoke your authorization or request the deletion of your data, when there is no legal duty preventing it.",
  "politicaSeccion7Titulo": "7. Use of local storage",
  "politicaSeccion7Texto": "SEREO uses local storage on your device (similar to cookies in web applications) to keep your session active and remember your preferences, such as the visual theme. This information remains only on your device.",
  "politicaSeccion8Titulo": "8. Acceptance",
  "politicaSeccion8Texto": "Using SEREO requires express acceptance of this policy, in accordance with Law 1581 of 2012 and its implementing decrees.",
